note Two handwritten fixed sm121 kernels: f32 residual add and elementwise product.
note Offline LAB capsules only. No launcher, compiler frontend or CPU fallback.
note VECTOR_1D ABI from immutable seed57f5f425, reads two f32 vectors, writes one.
global kbytes uchar 544
global ksize ulong 1
fn kword w ulong to void
for i ulong 4
put kbytes get ksize 0 uchar and shr w mul i 8 255
put ksize 0 add get ksize 0 1
end
end
fn kins a ulong b ulong c ulong d ulong to void
kword a
kword b
kword c
kword d
end
fn kernel op ulong to ulong
put ksize 0 0
if gt op 1
ret 69
end
